# NexTech Pro - Tech Product Showcase

A modern, premium landing page for a fictional tech product featuring realistic device mockups and interactive pricing.

## 🌐 Live Demo
[View Live Site](https://wahomedev.github.io/tech-product-showcase/)

## 🛠️ Built With
- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript

## 📋 Features
- Realistic 3D phone mockups with CSS
- Animated floating effects
- Interactive pricing comparison
- Smooth scroll navigation
- Feature highlights with icons
- Responsive design for all devices
- Scroll-triggered animations

## 🎨 Design Highlights
- Apple-inspired clean aesthetic
- Purple gradient color scheme (#667eea, #764ba2)
- Card-based layout
- Glassmorphism effects
- Modern typography

